#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Discover how quantum and high-performance computing can be combined in a single workflow."
msgstr "Ketahui bagaimana pengkomputeran kuantum dan berprestasi tinggi boleh digabungkan dalam satu aliran kerja tunggal."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Keseluruhan"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran Keseluruhan {#overview}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/index/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/index/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course provides an overview of classical and quantum resources as well hybrid workflows with examples.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini memberi gambaran keseluruhan tentang sumber klasik dan kuantum serta aliran kerja hibrid dengan contoh-contoh.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang yang disyorkan {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is intended for two distinct groups of individuals: those with backgrounds in quantum computing but not in HPC, and those with backgrounds in HPC but not quantum computing. These technologies complement each other, and those with expertise in one are increasingly aware of the importance of the other. Learners can skip over sections in their own area of expertise as appropriate.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini ditujukan kepada dua kumpulan individu yang berbeza: mereka yang berlatar belakang dalam pengkomputeran kuantum tetapi bukan HPC, dan mereka yang berlatar belakang dalam HPC tetapi bukan pengkomputeran kuantum. Teknologi-teknologi ini saling melengkapi, dan mereka yang pakar dalam satu bidang semakin sedar tentang kepentingan yang lain. Peserta boleh melangkau bahagian dalam bidang kepakaran mereka sendiri jika sesuai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We recommend that learners complete the following prerequisite prior to this course:\n"
msgstr "Kami mengesyorkan peserta melengkapkan prasyarat berikut sebelum kursus ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your local environment by following along with the [Get started](/guides/) guide in our documentation page.\n"
msgstr "Sediakan persekitaran tempatan anda dengan mengikuti panduan [Mulakan](/guides/) di halaman dokumentasi kami.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a deeper understanding of quantum information, complete this optional course:\n"
"- [Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) with John Watrous.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk pemahaman yang lebih mendalam tentang maklumat kuantum, lengkapkan kursus pilihan ini:\n"
"- [Asas maklumat kuantum](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) bersama John Watrous.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Peperiksaan {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Integrating Quantum and High-Performance Computing, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Untuk memperoleh lencana anda bagi Integrating Quantum and High-Performance Computing, ambil peperiksaan di IBM&reg; Training. Peperiksaan ini bertujuan untuk diambil selepas membaca pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Selepas anda lulus peperiksaan, Credly akan memberitahu anda bahawa anda telah memperoleh lencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Peperiksaan](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Awarded Badge {#awarded-badge}"
msgstr "Lencana yang dianugerahkan {#awarded-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/exam/badge.svg)\n"
